  "body": [
    "This El Capitan–tier Sprinter 170 AWD is engineered for travelers who want true independence on the road. It delivers massive off-grid power, refined comfort, and rugged capability without relying on anything outside the van. Every system in this build is designed for reliability, longevity, and ease of use — from energy to storage to climate control.",
    "With an 800Ah battery bank, dual DC-DC chargers, upgraded suspension, expanded fuel range, full plumbing, and full climate systems, this setup offers the freedom to explore for days or even weeks at a time. Inside, the layout stays clean and warm with butcher block finishes, wood-stained ceiling, modern lighting, and a functional kitchen and dinette. Outside, it’s equipped with winch power, roof rack, exterior lighting, and carries all the gear you need without sacrificing interior space.",
